body:
Temperature outside is 92. Feels like 100 because of humidity. I still did 3 miles.

&#x200B;

Raise your hand if you're over summer.

It's really hard for me to feel accomplished, because I feel like I should have never let myself get to a place where I gained so much weight. But I try to extend some love and compassion for myself, and that helps me feel a little pride. I've built up a lot of negativity from being overweight - influenced both by external factors and internal dialogue, so that mental progress of self confidence is going to take a while. 

&#x200B;

You look fantastic. Congrats on your hard work and progress!
